{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e0cfd176eabe35a82e9c4cb0215f9229209bf14d884e1536a6960dcf614e6570", "ja": "（亜利沙はコスプレグラビア企画で、獣人学園ドラマに\nゲストとして出演する。今日はその撮影日だ）", "zh": "（亚利沙将在一档角色扮演写真企划中，作为嘉宾出演兽人学园剧。今天就是拍摄日。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "11be7aeb0636ec9089cd125707e679976554a078235db1e21e2a8b7292f6d414", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。\n{$P$}さん、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……。\n{$P$}先生，怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1002_p", "source_sha256": "de2d9d828f2d5c71e6a0a4ca99d12fdd569eb951bd38749a248e8257200acfff", "ja": "良い全力疾走だったよ、亜利沙。\n迫力のあるライバルとの対決シーンになったよ。", "zh": "跑得很棒啊，亚利沙。拍出了和气势十足的对手展开对决的场面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "5a65a213fac7b0be988dab9271e314fc4812655e265c4da3fd90075302280372", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかったー！\nありさの体力を絞り出した甲斐がありました……！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了——！\n看来把亚利沙的体力全都榨出来是值得的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "53650b9a4d394c44bfeb5cb1f6fca189fec1eb7afcc10ddcbd00a6e5b44209df", "ja": "何度も走っては飛んで、走っては飛んで……\nもうヘトヘトを通り越して、ヘロヘロですぅ……。", "zh": "跑了又跳，跳了又跑……一次又一次……\n已经累得不只是筋疲力尽，而是整个人都软绵绵的了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ce74684223ea2ce2857dc344e4b0c3394002bc099297b2c936202c5d9c0fe6ca", "ja": "うん、そうだよな……。\n次の出番まで時間があるから、控室にでも……。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样……。\n离下次上场还有一段时间，去休息室什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "0d782f0c3700e3e0a79ae49b5ca1f7dfda6eeb754433959221805b836ea1c293", "ja": "いえ！　ありさは、ここで撮影を見ます！\nヒョウ獣人として、目を離すわけにはいきません！", "zh": "不！亚利沙要在这里看拍摄！\n身为豹兽人，绝不能移开视线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f302a0a8caf5b728194051e7c3851c7c043db052bd146465523bc16fc3d19280", "ja": "でも、ヘロヘロなんじゃ……。", "zh": "不过，你不是已经累得筋疲力尽了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f91d89ddf763625d26158822c09bb66d5f2cd0425708259e8fc6c9b5ce00b1a", "ja": "「あなたがもっと進化しても、私が負けることは\nないわ。どんな環境にも適応するのが、私だもの」", "zh": "“就算你进一步进化，我也绝不会\n输给你。毕竟无论面对怎样的环境，我都能适应”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b7b1b6de12726307c619fac56f99aa95f1f244eb13f24f762028ff9611adf18", "ja": "ありさ、このセリフ結構好きなんです。強者の台詞です\nけど、その裏ではたくさん努力をしたと思うと……。", "zh": "亚利沙挺喜欢这句台词的。虽然是强者说出的话，\n但一想到背后付出了那么多努力，就觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "2180e5ec53b0a23f0220a798d2f4f6d2a6ffa1f4fddd8d88e629865727feab9e", "ja": "ありさも、この子に負けてられないなって。\n……一話だけのゲストですけど。", "zh": "亚利沙也觉得，自己不能输给这孩子呢。\n……虽然只是登场一集的女嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0abdf5803fe44bfc0dda337ee4d09c08820c1d38a8e8bb65518879d84da98c4d", "ja": "そうか。いい心がけだと思うよ。\n……まあ、今回限りのゲストだけど。", "zh": "这样啊。我觉得你有这份心态很好。\n……不过嘛，这次只是客串而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "f52c1f6f7f560893ea91d5341e8b64362ce89590d72f4531bcb2659a2ad94768", "ja": "だから、この現場をよく見て、よく聞いて……\nありさも現場に適応して、いい役にしたいんです。", "zh": "所以，我要好好观察、好好倾听现场的一切……\n让自己适应现场，成为一个出色的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ee065dce47a19ceb1a6e67f0fb2e1ce0b3857367c8f21c268113fa1805631b63", "ja": "なるほど……。亜利沙の気持ちはよくわかった。\n何か邪な気持ちがあるんじゃって疑ってしまったよ。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白亚利沙的心情了。\n我还怀疑你是不是抱着什么不纯的想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "43b2f58cd8532c76021b66b9ac13eee469fa724c0d632dbf5088d68b30eb0960", "ja": "ギクッ！　……あ、あははっ！\n何言ってるんですか、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "咯噔！……啊、啊哈哈！\n您在说什么呢，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1015_p", "source_sha256": "848cc719c97dc9cdd7abfe997596fad48173527cd25dd20bc380971cda1cdd0f", "ja": "ははっ、そうだよな！\nとりあえず、亜利沙は体力を回復させないと。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是！\n总之，亚利沙得先恢复体力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0573_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f402512fa7f9d4952ebc36c60afed405cd2c6a57aaec220cdca61e9b1e20281b", "ja": "はい！　……あっ。向こうの高いとこなら全体が\n見えますね。しっかり、じっくりと……ムフフ。", "zh": "好的！……啊。在那边的高处就能看到全貌了呢。仔细地、好好地观察……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
